---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Woodfox Coffee Company handles information when you visit woodfoxcoffee.com or contact us."
  updated="October 14, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information {site.legalName} (“Woodfox Coffee,” “we,” “us”) collects when you visit
    woodfoxcoffee.com or contact us, and how we use it. We aim to collect as little as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Information you choose to send us</h2>
  <p>
    Our contact and wholesale forms open your own email app with your message addressed to us. We receive only what
    you choose to send: typically your name, email address, message and, for wholesale inquiries, your business name,
    business type, estimated coffee needs and (optionally) phone number.
  </p>
  <p>We use this information only to reply to you and, for wholesale inquiries, to discuss a potential partnership.</p>

  <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>No analytics or advertising tracking.</strong> This website does not use analytics, advertising pixels or
      tracking cookies.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like most web hosts, GitHub may process technical
      data such as your IP address to deliver the site and keep it secure. See GitHub’s privacy statement for details.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Images.</strong> Some photographs are currently loaded from Unsplash (images.unsplash.com), which receives
      standard request data such as your IP address when those images load.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fonts and video</strong> are served from our own site, not from third-party font or video services.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Online ordering (future)</h2>
  <p>
    Online ordering is not yet available. When it launches, payments will be processed by a third-party payment
    provider <mark class="confirm">[owner to confirm provider, e.g. Stripe, Square or Shopify]</mark>. We will never
    receive or store your full card details. Your cart may be stored in your browser’s local storage on your own device.
    This policy will be updated before ordering opens.
  </p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell or rent personal information. We share it only with service providers needed to run our business
    (for example, our email provider), or when required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep correspondence for as long as needed to respond and maintain business records
    <mark class="confirm">[owner to confirm retention period]</mark>, then delete it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us what information we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, by emailing
    <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We’ll update this page if our practices change, and revise the date at the top.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName}, {site.location}.
    Email: <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a> · Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
    {!site.emailConfirmed && <mark class="confirm">[owner to confirm address]</mark>}
  </p>
</Legal>
